      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NICOLOSI (5) is a bright prospect from the Waterhouse/Bott yard. Led all the way for a very soft maiden win over 1200m at Nowra last start. Has only raced three times so there is plenty of scope for further improvement. This is a big step up but trust the stable has got it right. IN HER NAME (4) was facing the starter for only the second time when she had to call on all reserves to get the bob in over 1300m at Newcastle last time out. Drawn to enjoy a lovely run and will prove tough to hold out again. STUNNING FUTURE (7) sat just off the speed then closed too well for a maiden field over this distance at the Beaumont track recently. Should enjoy a similar run in transit today so expect another bold performance. OBSIDIAN DREAM (6) found 1200m a little sharp when fresh from a spell here last start. Best form comes at this distance so she definitely puts her hand up. SHEEZA DIVA (1) returned in good shape here last start and will appreciate the extra 150m this afternoon.",
